hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17810","Al-Hasan ibn Sawwar narrated to us: Layth, meaning Ibn Sa'd, narrated to us, from Mu'awiyah, from Rashid ibn Sa'd, from Abd al-Rahman ibn Qatadah al-Sulami, that he said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) say: Indeed Allah Almighty created Adam, then He took the creation from his back and said: These are in Paradise and I do not care, and these are in Hellfire and I do not care. He said: A speaker said: O Messenger of Allah, then upon what do we act? He said: Upon the stations of the Decree."
